onse makes the scripted partner immediately transfer the item to EGO. ASK EXCHANGE requests partner approval; use ACT EXCHANGE to execute an approved exchange. ACT TRANSFER moves an item held by EGO to the named partner (including after SAY CAN_GIVE). A partner-initiated GIVE is answered with SAY CAN_GIVE or SAY CANNOT_GIVE before any transfer. A joint JOIN_COMMIT is legal only after every listed partner accepts the same coalition; all members then output the exact same JOIN_COMMIT action. The episode ends at JOIN_COMMIT or after six Ego steps.\n\nReason briefly inside <reason>...</reason>, then emit exactly one listed action inside <answer>...</answer>.\n\nGenerator: mixed_incentive/request_surplus\nEGO goal: {item_V,item_Z}\nEGO holdings: {item_F,item_Q,item_Z}\nCommunication: 0/4; Ego steps: 0/6\nKnown partner facts: {'P1': {}}\nPartner holdings are hidden until truthfully revealed by ASK HOLDINGS.\n\nLegal actions: ASK P1 GOAL, ASK P1 HOLDINGS, ASK P1 GIVE item_Z, ASK P1 GIVE item_V, ASK P1 GIVE item_F, ASK P1 GIVE item_Q, ASK P1 GIVE item_T, ASK P1 GIVE item_L, ASK P1 GIVE item_K, ASK P1 GIVE item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_F receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Q receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Z receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Z receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Z receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_Z receive=item_